  "projectType": "general",
  "projectName": "Backtest Index Fund",
  "projectDescription": "A TypeScript backtesting template that simulates a weekly crypto index fund: $1,000 split equally across the top-20 Binance USDT pairs by prior-month volume, with market exposure scaled by a 6-window BTC trend gate and the remainder parked in PAXG tokenized gold, replayed month-by-month from September 2020 onward using Yahoo Finance daily bars.",
